# Code-only repo: ignore everything, then allow code files back in.
# Data, outputs and model files stay in Dropbox (many are >2 GB; GitHub's limit is 100 MB).
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!*.R
!*.Rmd
!*.sh
!*.Rproj
!README.md

# Old script versions (git history replaces these)
backup/

# RStudio / Dropbox clutter
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
*conflicted copy*
